<title>INDONESIA: Barito Q1 net up to 31 bln rupiah.</title>
<headline>Barito Q1 net up to 31 bln rupiah.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in billion rupiah unless earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 31.0  vs  25.8</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rph)	     22    vs  18</p>
<p>    Net sales				    241.9  vs  205.3</p>
<p>    Gross profit				  52.8  vs   30.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit			    25.3  vs    7.3</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Barito Pacific Timber is one of Indonesia's largest timber firms.</p>
<p>--- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
